@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

card "Original\nrequest" as O
card "Interpretation" as I
card "Decision\n(§3 category)" as D
card "Verification\ncondition" as C
card "Code\n(.ghost.md, GFB)" as P
card "Execution\n(run / scan)" as E
card "Real device\n(observation)" as R

O --> I : external authoring system
I --> D : confirmation flow /\npolicy applier
D --> C : author /\nverification designer
C --> P : authoring tool\n+ compiler
P --> E : execution /\nverification tool
E --> R : device / host /\nobserver
note bottom of D
  Each link carries its own revisions.
  A missing link leaves only the claims
  that depend on it unknown.
end note
@enduml
